    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e9f2d3eccf3148013e0cde8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我很不甘心，作为担当训练员，\n我什么话都讲不出来，没办法依靠自己想出办法，\n真的是太可悲了――",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e5e825af450f2c970a8c839d669a3da7880b70129a2f9a9f07c0cdc06d050ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa6597c2e205ac9b7f223079",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尽管如此还是能找到办法的，\n事到如今只能去向“那位”求助。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44aff7ad7dc9c78e1d9480780331f8c208255c12c45f6e45411916d38d18a588",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077114.json",
      "json_path": [
